key.aoc.tooltip.entity=Stops drawing entities outside the camera frustum. Entities remain alive and active.
key.aoc.tooltip.tile=Stops drawing TileEntities outside the camera frustum. TileEntities remain loaded.
key.aoc.tooltip.occlusion=Uses bounded main-thread world sampling plus asynchronous result processing to hide objects fully behind solid blocks.
key.aoc.tooltip.animations=Reduces the global animated-texture update rate. This is safer with OptiFine than rewriting its sprite animation internals.
key.aoc.tooltip.distance=Maximum distance checked by AOC. This is a render check only; it does not unload or deactivate objects.
key.aoc.tooltip.budget=Maximum world ray checks performed per client tick. Lower values reduce CPU spikes.
key.aoc.tooltip.interval=How often animated atlas textures are advanced. 1 is normal speed; higher values reduce animation work.
key.aoc.optifine_missing=OptiFine HD U G5 is required by Android Optimization Core.
